# Internal design and QA notes. They belong in the repository as a record
# of why things are built the way they are, but a deploy serves the whole
# tree at the domain root -- without this, grubmonkeys.in/README-CLAUDE.md
# and the rest would be publicly readable.
*.md

# GM Command Center: a separate Next.js app (own Vercel project, own
# dashboard.grubmonkeys.in domain), kept in this repo only because a new
# repo couldn't be created. This project's deploy serves the whole tree at
# the domain root, so without this its full source -- including backend
# security/auth logic -- would be publicly readable at grubmonkeys.in/command-center/.
command-center/
